  "type": "module",
  "description": "简谱（JP-Word/.jpwabc）与文本谱（番茄简谱 / 诗歌本动态谱）在线排版与编辑器，支持图片识谱（OMR）、简谱·五线谱混排、MusicXML 导入导出与 PDF/PNG/MIDI/PPTX 导出 · An open-source jianpu (numbered musical notation) editor & typesetter.",
  "homepage": "https://lodebar2026.github.io/jpeditor/",
  "repository": {
